  "summary_zh": "從史科嘉瀑布，旁邊的步道走上，當你走上步到起，步行 20-30 分鐘左右， 你會接連看到 3 個小瀑布，蠻值得一來的。\n\n在這上面，步行 20 分鐘內，你會看到三個瀑布 - 馬渡瀑布、福斯托爾瀑布、石拱瀑布，如果你旅行時間較為彈性，我蠻推薦走上來看看的，你會發現史科嘉瀑布上游是這景觀。",
  "summary_en": "From the Skógar waterfall, follow the nearby trail upward. After about a 20‑30 minute walk you’ll encounter three small waterfalls in succession, making it well worth a visit. Within the first 20 minutes of walking you’ll see three waterfalls—the Matarfoss, Fosstorfufoss, and Stone Arch waterfall. If you have a flexible schedule, it’s highly recommended to hike up and explore, as you’ll discover that the upstream area of Skógar waterfall offers this scenic view.",
